('haven-soft-arch-mirror-warm-wood', 'Haven Soft Arch Mirror – Warm Wood', 'Floor Mirrors', 30000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 4, 1, '25LD091004', 'MH-HAVEN-WWD', '', '190 cm high × 100 cm wide', 'New', false, '["images/products/haven-soft-arch-mirror-warm-wood.jpg","images/products/haven-soft-arch-mirror-detail.jpg","images/products/haven-soft-arch-mirror-back.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Soft, sculptural and beautifully simple. The Haven is a 190 cm arched floor mirror with a thick, rounded frame in a warm honey-toned wood that curves gently around every edge, from the arched top to the softly rounded base. Warm and inviting, it brings light and a relaxed, modern feel to bedrooms, living rooms and entryways. Lean it against the wall, or hang it using the sturdy hangers on the back.', '["190 cm high × 100 cm wide","Thick, rounded frame in warm honey-toned wood","Arched top with softly rounded base corners","Hang on the wall (hangers on the back) or lean against it","Also available in Dark Brown, Black, Natural and White","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 6),
