('riviera-rounded-floor-mirror-gold', 'Riviera Rounded Floor Mirror – Gold', 'Floor Mirrors', 33000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 0, NULL, '', 'MH-RIV-GLD', '', '200 cm high × 100 cm wide', '', false, '["images/products/riviera-rounded-floor-mirror-gold.jpg","images/products/riviera-rounded-floor-mirror-gold-back.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Soft curves meet golden glamour. The Riviera is a 200 cm full-length floor mirror in a slim gold metal frame with gently rounded corners, bringing warmth, light and an elegant, modern-luxe feel to any room. Perfect for bedrooms, living rooms, dressing rooms and entryways. Lean it against the wall, or hang it using the sturdy D-ring hangers on the back.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Slim gold metal frame with softly rounded corners","Hang on the wall (D-ring hangers on the back) or lean against it","Full-length floor mirror","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 11),
('soho-slim-frame-mirror-black', 'Soho Slim Frame Mirror – Black', 'Floor Mirrors', 25000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 8, 1, 'Q1085', 'MH-SOHO-BLK', '', '190 cm high × 90 cm wide', 'New', false, '["images/products/soho-slim-frame-mirror-black.jpg","images/products/soho-slim-frame-mirror-black-detail.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Clean, modern and effortlessly versatile. The Soho is a 190 cm full-length mirror in a slim black metal frame with crisp, mitred corners, letting the reflection take centre stage. It brightens and opens up bedrooms, living rooms, hallways and entryways, and suits everything from minimalist to Hamptons interiors. Hang it on the wall or lean it against it.', '["190 cm high × 90 cm wide","Slim black metal frame with mitred corners","Hang on the wall or lean against it","Full-length rectangle mirror","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 12),
('cathedral-arch-window-mirror-black', 'Cathedral Arch Window Mirror – Black', 'Floor Mirrors', 30000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 2, NULL, '', 'MH-CATH-BLK', '', '190 cm high × 100 cm wide', 'New', false, '["images/products/cathedral-arch-window-mirror-black-styled.jpg","images/products/cathedral-arch-window-mirror-black-2.jpg","images/products/cathedral-arch-window-mirror-black-arch.jpg","images/products/cathedral-arch-window-mirror-black-detail.jpg","images/products/cathedral-arch-window-mirror-black-back.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Step into timeless architecture with the Cathedral. A slim black metal frame traces a graceful arch, with a second arch set inside and fine window-pane bars fanning out above, like light through an old cathedral window. At 190 cm high and 100 cm wide, it brings height, light and character to living rooms, bedrooms and entryways. Lean it against the wall, or hang it using the sturdy wall hooks on the back.', '["190 cm high × 100 cm wide","Black metal frame with an inner arch and window-pane design","Hang on the wall (wall hooks on the back) or lean against it","Perfect for living rooms, bedrooms and entryways","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 13),
('belgravia-crest-mirror-gold', 'Belgravia Crest Mirror – Gold', 'Floor Mirrors', 59900, NULL, NULL, 'active', 2, 1, 'LPU12302', 'MH-BELG-GLD', '', '210 cm high × 120 cm wide', 'New', false, '["images/products/belgravia-crest-mirror-gold-2.jpg","images/products/belgravia-crest-mirror-trio.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Grand, romantic and made to be noticed. The Belgravia is a 210 cm full-length mirror in a rich antique-gold frame, crowned with an ornate carved crest and finished with scrolled corner details and a fine beaded border. An inner panelled frame adds depth and old-world craftsmanship, making it a stunning focal point for living rooms, bedrooms, dressing rooms and grand entryways.', '["210 cm high × 120 cm wide","Ornate frame with a carved crest, scrolled corners and a beaded border","Inner panelled frame for added depth","Full-length statement mirror","Also available in Champagne and Black","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 14),
