('versailles-ornate-mirror-190-gold', 'Versailles Ornate Mirror 190 × 90 cm – Gold', 'Floor Mirrors', 25000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 0, 1, 'RF 11002', 'MH-VERS190-GLD', '', '190 cm high × 90 cm wide', 'New', true, '["images/products/versailles-ornate-mirror-gold.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Make an entrance with the Versailles: a 190 cm full-length mirror framed in rich antique gold, with hand-detailed baroque scrollwork crowning every corner. All the opulence of our larger Versailles in a size that suits bedrooms, dressing rooms and hallways. Hang it vertically or horizontally, or lean it against the wall.', '["190 cm high × 90 cm wide","Ornate baroque frame in a rich antique gold","Hang vertically or horizontally, or lean against the wall","Also available in Black and Champagne, and in 220 × 110 cm","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 28),
