('versailles-ornate-mirror-190-champagne', 'Versailles Ornate Mirror 190 × 90 cm – Champagne', 'Floor Mirrors', 25000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 1, 1, 'RF 11002', 'MH-VERS190-CHA', '', '190 cm high × 90 cm wide', 'New', true, '["images/products/versailles-ornate-mirror-champagne-2.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'The Versailles in soft champagne, in a 190 cm full-length size: ornate baroque scrollwork in a gentle, pale-gold finish. Luxurious but understated, it brings quiet glamour to bedrooms, dressing rooms and hallways. Hang it vertically or horizontally, or lean it against the wall.', '["190 cm high × 90 cm wide","Ornate baroque frame in a soft champagne gold","Hang vertically or horizontally, or lean against the wall","Also available in Gold and Black, and in 220 × 110 cm","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 30),
('versailles-ornate-mirror-gold', 'Versailles Ornate Mirror 220 × 110 cm – Gold', 'Floor Mirrors', 34000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 3, 1, 'RF 11002-F', 'MH-VERS-GLD', '33.8', '220 cm high × 110 cm wide', 'New', true, '["images/products/versailles-ornate-mirror-gold.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Make an entrance with the Versailles: a grand 220 cm mirror framed in rich antique gold, with hand-detailed baroque scrollwork crowning every corner. Timeless, opulent and full of light, it turns any living room, bedroom or entryway into something special. Hang it vertically or horizontally, or lean it against the wall.', '["220 cm high × 110 cm wide","Weight: 33.8 kg","Ornate baroque frame in a rich antique gold","Hang vertically or horizontally, or lean against the wall","Also available in Black and Champagne, and in 190 × 90 cm","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 31),
