('monolith-arch-mirror-concrete', 'Monolith Arch Mirror – Concrete', 'Floor Mirrors', 30000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 3, 1, 'HS45131-Brad', 'MH-MONO-CON', '', '200 cm high × 100 cm wide', 'New', false, '["images/products/monolith-arch-mirror-concrete.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Sculpted in a soft concrete finish, the Monolith is a 2-metre arched mirror with a stepped, layered frame that feels part architecture, part art. Hang it or lean it against the wall to bring light and calm, gallery-like presence to entryways, living rooms and bedrooms.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Stepped arched frame in a concrete finish","Hang on the wall or lean against it","Also available in Black","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 34),
