('gatsby-arch-mirror-black', 'Gatsby Arch Mirror – Black', 'Floor Mirrors', 24000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 7, 1, 'HS302010B-BRAD', 'MH-GATS-BLK', '', '200 cm high × 100 cm wide', 'New', false, '["images/products/gatsby-arch-mirror-black-2.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Step into the Jazz Age with the Gatsby: a 2-metre arched mirror in a black metal frame of layered arches and sculptural round accents, inspired by Art Deco design. Hang it or lean it against the wall for a glamorous focal point in entryways, living rooms and bedrooms.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Black metal frame with layered Art Deco arches and round accents","Hang on the wall or lean against it","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 36),
('duchess-arch-mirror-black', 'Duchess Arch Mirror – Black', 'Floor Mirrors', 30000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 0, NULL, '', 'MH-DUCH-BLK', '', '200 cm high × 100 cm wide', '', false, '["images/products/duchess-arch-mirror-black.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'Meet the Duchess: a 2-metre arched mirror in a slim black metal frame, crowned with an ornate carved crest for a touch of old-world elegance. Hang it or lean it against the wall to bring light, height and quiet grandeur to bedrooms, hallways and living spaces.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Slim black metal frame with an arched top and ornate carved crest","Hang on the wall or lean against it","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 37),
('wavy-edge-wall-mirror', 'Wavy Edge Wall Mirror', 'Wall Mirrors', 30000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 10, NULL, '', 'MH-WAVE-BLK', '', '200 cm high × 100 cm wide', 'New', true, '["images/products/wavy-edge-wall-mirror.jpg","images/products/wavy-edge-wall-mirror-horizontal.jpg","images/products/wavy-edge-wall-mirror-leaned.jpg","images/products/wavy-edge-wall-mirror-hallway.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'A soft, wavy black timber frame turns this 2-metre mirror into a statement piece. Stylish and modern, it brightens bedrooms, living areas, hallways and entryways, and can be hung vertically or horizontally, or simply leaned against the wall.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Durable wood frame in a timeless black finish","Hang vertically or horizontally, or lean against the wall","Perfect for bedrooms, living areas, hallways and entryways","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 38),
('studio-box-mirror-black', 'Studio Box Mirror – Black', 'Floor Mirrors', 25000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 3, 1, 'D3155', 'MH-SB-BLK', '', '', 'New', true, '["images/products/studio-box-mirror-black-2.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'A generous 2-metre, full-length mirror in a natural timber box frame finished in matte black. Clean, modern lines frame the room and bounce light into hallways, bedrooms and living spaces. Hang it vertically or horizontally, or lean it against the wall.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Natural timber box frame, finished in matte black","Hang vertically or horizontally, or lean against the wall","Also available in Walnut, Natural Oak","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 39),
('studio-box-mirror-walnut', 'Studio Box Mirror – Walnut', 'Floor Mirrors', 25000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 3, 1, 'D3155', 'MH-SB-WAL', '', '', 'New', true, '["images/products/studio-box-mirror-walnut.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'A generous 2-metre, full-length mirror in a natural timber box frame with a rich walnut tone. Warm grain and clean lines add depth and a relaxed, crafted feel to any room. Hang it vertically or horizontally, or lean it against the wall.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Natural timber box frame, in a rich walnut tone","Hang vertically or horizontally, or lean against the wall","Also available in Black, Natural Oak","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 40),
('studio-box-mirror-natural-oak', 'Studio Box Mirror – Natural Oak', 'Floor Mirrors', 25000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 3, 1, 'D3155', 'MH-SB-OAK', '', '', 'New', true, '["images/products/studio-box-mirror-natural-oak.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'A generous 2-metre, full-length mirror in a light natural oak box frame. Soft, honey-toned timber and clean lines bring light, warmth and calm to hallways, bedrooms and living spaces. Hang it vertically or horizontally, or lean it against the wall.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Natural timber box frame, in a light natural oak","Hang vertically or horizontally, or lean against the wall","Also available in Black, Walnut","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 41),
('statement-curve-mirror-gold', 'Statement Curve Mirror – Gold', 'Wall Mirrors', 35000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 5, 1, '22Ld091609', 'MH-SC-GLD', '', '', 'New', true, '["images/signature-gold.jpg","images/signature-gold-pair.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'A 2-metre statement mirror with a bold gold metal frame and elegant curved detailing that adds style, light and depth to any space. Buy two for a 200 cm × 200 cm feature wall.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Gold metal frame with curved detailing","Set of two: $700, forming a 200 cm × 200 cm feature wall","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 42),
('statement-curve-mirror-black', 'Statement Curve Mirror – Black', 'Wall Mirrors', 35000, NULL, NULL, 'active', 5, 1, '22Ld091609', 'MH-SC-BLK', '', '', 'New', true, '["images/signature-black.jpg","images/signature-black-pair.jpg"]'::jsonb, 'A 2-metre statement mirror with a bold black metal frame and elegant curved detailing that adds style, light and depth to any space. Buy two for a 200 cm × 200 cm feature wall.', '["200 cm high × 100 cm wide","Black metal frame with curved detailing","Set of two: $700, forming a 200 cm × 200 cm feature wall","Ships in a heavy-duty cardboard box with protective foam"]'::jsonb, 43),
